  "goodToKnow": "Resigniert means resigned or defeated, having given up hope: resigniert aufgeben, resigniert seufzen. Resignieren means to give up inwardly, not to leave a job; that's zurücktreten (from office) or kündigen (from a job). Die Resignation is resignation in the sense of hopelessness. Synonyms: entmutigt, mutlos. The opposite is zuversichtlich."
